#. Description of the plugin
#: reviewbird-plugin.php
msgid "Automated review collection for WooCommerce that blocks spam, catches complaints, and showcases your best feedback."
msgstr "Automatiseret anmeldelsessamling til WooCommerce, der blokerer spam, fanger klager og fremviser din bedste feedback."

