#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:161
msgid "See It In Action"
msgstr "Se det i aktion"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:164
msgid "A quick look at the Reviewbird widget"
msgstr "Et hurtigt kig på Reviewbird-widgeten"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:170
msgid "Leaving a review shouldn't feel like applying for a loan. Our widget makes review submission easy and painless."
msgstr "At skrive en anmeldelse skal ikke føles som at ansøge om et lån. Vores widget gør det nemt og smertefrit at indsende anmeldelser."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:181
